// graphbot is a nested example module that proves a third party can build a
// bot on Aisotropy's PUBLIC surface only. The replace directive points at the
// repo root so the example tracks local changes; because this is a separate
// module, Go forbids it from importing github.com/Luum-Home/aisotropy/internal/...
module github.com/Luum-Home/aisotropy/examples/graphbot

go 1.25.1

require github.com/Luum-Home/aisotropy v0.0.0

require (
	github.com/BurntSushi/toml v1.6.0 // indirect
